Mesa 3D Graphics Library (llvmpipe software OpenGL)
---------------------------------------------------

Shipped with the Windows build only, as `opengl32.dll` and
`libgallium_wgl.dll` installed next to the executable, to provide a software
OpenGL renderer on GPU-less Windows (VMs, RDP, minimal/Server installs).

  Component : Mesa 3D (llvmpipe / gallium WGL driver)
  Version   : 26.1.6
  Source    : https://github.com/pal1000/mesa-dist-win
              release asset `mesa3d-26.1.6-release-msvc.7z`
              (upstream project: https://mesa3d.org/)

